Bug #1
201 status code is from the get request

Precondition: as a verified user
Steps to Reproduce:
1. Send GET request to http://localhost:49000/zip-codes
2. Verify the response
Actual result: 201 status code is returned, where list of zip codes: ["12345","23456","ABCDE"]
Expected result: Should get 200 status code and available zip codes should return list ["12345","23456","ABCDE"]

Bug #2
Duplicates of available zip codes are added to the codes

Precondition: as a verified user
Steps to Reproduce:
1. Send GET request to get the codes http://localhost:49000/zip-codes
2. Verify "12345" is in the codes response
2. Send POST request to http://localhost:49000/zip-codes/expand, where body: ["12345"] - trying to add one more the same code
4. Verify the response
Actual result: 201 status code is returned, duplicates are added
Expected result: 201 status code is returned, and the zip codes should be added to the available zip codes without any duplications

